        "text": "Grok @Bot can now call US businesses for you, and it's one of my favorite AI features ever.\n\nHere's my new video where I play a real call of my bot successfully negotiating with Comcast to cut my internet bill by almost $500 a year.\n\nSome highlights include my bot:\n→ Responding to \"How's the weather?\"\n→ Turning down 3 upsells from the rep\n→ Pushing the rep with a rival's lower offer\n\n📌 Watch now: https://youtu.be/F-356TczoQU",
